1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 14=

10
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,920
It's you, Prince Qi.

11
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,030
I thought

12
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:58,790
some rat from the gutter

13
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:00,560
had finally crawled into the light.

14
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,110
Still talking tough

15
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:02,990
when you're on death's doorstep?

16
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:05,560
I'm impressed.

17
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:07,040
To lure me here,

18
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,400
you framed me

19
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,560
and forged evidence.

20
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,680
Surely you went to
quite a lot of trouble.

21
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:16,350
I did it willingly.

22
00:01:17,130 --> 00:01:18,200
They've all got people on my side

23
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,150
in the Court of Judicial Review.

24
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:21,150
They'll make sure

25
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:23,590
you're found guilty and executed.

26
00:01:24,230 --> 00:01:25,200
By then,

27
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:27,560
there'll be no Qi Yuan in this world.

28
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,510
Only a lowly servant

29
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:30,480
in my residence.

30
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,640
And you'll be at my mercy.

31
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,350
Your Highness,

32
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,310
you're celebrating too soon.

33
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:46,710
Your Majesty,

34
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,280
did you hear that?

35
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:50,120
I have been wronged.

36
00:01:50,510 --> 00:01:52,680
Please investigate, Your Majesty.

37
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,310
Bluffing.

38
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:59,150
Why would His Majesty
come to such a filthy place?

39
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,510
If I hadn't come,

40
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:05,310
how would I know my good son
was running a private brothel

41
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,990
and forcing decent women
into prostitution?

42
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:07,950
And even

43
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,000
turning the Court of Judicial Review

44
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,560
into his own private den

45
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,080
from cronyism and murder.

46
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,150
Father!

47
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:20,800
Hong Xiao, you're not dead?

48
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,750
If she were dead,

49
00:02:22,870 --> 00:02:24,800
who would testify to your crimes?

50
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,430
Prince Qi is ruthless.

51
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:31,890
He would definitely come after you.

52
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,870
This soft armor will keep you safe.

53
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:36,150
I was being foolish,

54
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:36,960
Father.

55
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,150
It was Prince Cheng.

56
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:40,800
He incited me to do this.

57
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,360
That's enough.

58
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,360
At this point,

59
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:46,430
you still drag others down with you.

60
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:47,710
Issue the decree.

61
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:52,000
From today on, strip Prince Qi
of his princely title.

62
00:02:52,330 --> 00:02:53,860
- Reduce him to a commandery prince.
- Father.

63
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:55,790
Remain confined at your residence
and reflect on your sins.

64
00:02:55,870 --> 00:02:56,590
Without summons,

65
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,870
you are not to step out.

66
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:00,870
As for Prince Cheng,

67
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:02,430
dock his salary for three years.

68
00:03:04,190 --> 00:03:05,590
- Your Majesty is wise.
- Your Majesty is wise.

69
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,910
Qi Yuan!

70
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,430
Hong Xiao!

71
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,680
You set me up.

72
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,030
Fortunately, the evidence
from Yueying Pleasure House

73
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:28,400
did not implicate you,
Grand Preceptor Zhou.

74
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:31,710
In court,

75
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,030
you are the only one

76
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,590
I can rely on.

77
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,400
Your Highness,

78
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,150
don't worry.

79
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:46,000
I have many students and proteges.

80
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:49,000
They can all be used for your cause.

81
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,710
Qi Yuan

82
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,120
is far too cunning.

83
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:56,150
She must not be left alive.

84
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,430
Qi Yuan...

85
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:03,840
I'll make you regret what you did today.

86
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,190
Your Highness,

87
00:04:05,630 --> 00:04:08,310
do you have a plan in mind?

88
00:04:10,940 --> 00:04:13,460
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

89
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:19,920
Are you all right?

90
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:21,480
Are you hurt?

91
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,480
What's wrong with you?

92
00:04:24,650 --> 00:04:25,750
What could possibly hurt me?

93
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,720
What about this?

94
00:04:32,870 --> 00:04:34,190
I didn't get this for you.

95
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:35,310
Not me.

96
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:37,600
Didn't you have Lianqiao bring this

97
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,310
to me

98
00:04:38,330 --> 00:04:40,360
and tell me to take Hong Xiao
to see His Majesty?

99
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,160
I didn't.

100
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:46,310
Your Highness,

101
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,680
we're just working together.

102
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,780
If you didn't do it,
why are you taking it from me?

103
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,510
You stayed by my side all night
that night.

104
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:53,800
Yes.

105
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,480
I kissed you.

106
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:54,950
So what?

107
00:04:54,950 --> 00:04:55,720
It was just a kiss.

108
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,560
What does that prove?

109
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,830
You can kiss me back if you want.

110
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,600
So...

111
00:05:08,750 --> 00:05:09,600
So was it real

112
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,480
that night?

113
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:25,550
♪Memories return to where it all began♪

114
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,560
Xiao Yunting,

115
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,000
our cooperation

116
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:30,870
is over.

117
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,480
Get out.

118
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:37,040
Out.

119
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,600
Out.

120
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:46,150
♪One attachment I can't let go of♪

121
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:50,240
♪I have loved for your sake♪

122
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,120
(Don't be so nice to me.)

123
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,000
(I might think you mean it.)

124
00:05:56,320 --> 00:06:02,700
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪

125
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:05,380
(Peaceful Residence)

126
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:11,950
Well, well.

127
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:15,040
This is a first.

128
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:16,560
Your Lordship,

129
00:06:16,750 --> 00:06:19,390
you actually made mooncakes.

130
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,430
For the mighty Marquis Yongping,

131
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:25,070
what is so hard about making mooncakes?

132
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:25,920
Grandfather,

133
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:28,950
you made these mooncakes
according to seniority.

134
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:29,750
They are big ones

135
00:06:29,750 --> 00:06:30,600
and small ones.

136
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,270
Even great-grandkid-sized ones.

137
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,040
Yuan,

138
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:37,560
the look of the mooncake doesn't matter.

139
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,720
A mooncake is like a man.

140
00:06:39,870 --> 00:06:41,560
What matters is the taste.

141
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,360
Come on.

142
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,240
Dig in

143
00:06:45,270 --> 00:06:45,920
and try them.

144
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,310
Grandfather,

145
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,120
these mooncakes are a little hard.

146
00:06:59,040 --> 00:06:59,590
Eat the dishes.

147
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,390
Eat the dishes first.

148
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,070
Why didn't I see

149
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:07,800
the servants bring in the fireworks?

150
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,560
Did they forget?

151
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,040
From now on, halve the fireworks.

152
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,280
Why?

153
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,160
Grandmother,

154
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,950
here is what I think.

155
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,920
I looked over the household accounts.

156
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,680
We're short of funds.

157
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,800
A festival like Mid-Autumn

158
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,270
costs a shocking amount.

159
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:30,120
So I thought we should
cut the spending in half,

160
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,510
and use the savings to buy each servant

161
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,270
a new set of clothes.

162
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:36,040
So they can have food and clothing too.

163
00:07:36,190 --> 00:07:37,560
Thank you, Young Lady Qi.

164
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:39,800
My dear Yuan,

165
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:42,870
you're clever and capable.

166
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:45,070
From now on, you can run the household.

167
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:47,070
I'll rest easy.

168
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:48,000
What?

169
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:49,950
Wait.

170
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,790
You said Yuan is going to
manage the household?

171
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:52,390
Wait.

172
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,800
Mother is still here.

173
00:07:54,090 --> 00:07:55,720
Why should she be the one running things?

174
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:00,120
The one who manages the household
should be the capable one.

175
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,240
Yuan

176
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:03,390
has pulled the Qi family

177
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:05,480
out of the mud time and again.

178
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,430
She is the one

179
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:10,360
who should hold this position.

180
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:10,920
No.

181
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:12,240
Grandmother...

182
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:13,600
Sit down.

183
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,480
All right.

184
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:17,120
Everyone, start eating.

185
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:17,720
Dig in.

186
00:08:19,740 --> 00:08:21,540
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

187
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,360
Bear this in mind.

188
00:08:22,510 --> 00:08:24,190
Do not say His Highness sent you.

189
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,320
Miss Qi.

190
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:34,910
What...

191
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:35,670
What a coincidence.

192
00:08:38,670 --> 00:08:39,550
Coincidence?

193
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,390
This is my home.

194
00:08:49,150 --> 00:08:50,270
What's that supposed to mean?

195
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,480
Have her handle the accounts?

196
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,150
Yes.

197
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,440
Young Lady Qi
has a terrible headache over it.

198
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,030
What are you laughing at?

199
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,200
Find a trusted accountant

200
00:09:01,210 --> 00:09:02,110
and go to the Qi Residence

201
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,360
to see what help you can offer.

202
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:03,910
Got it.

203
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,000
Just do not say I told you.

204
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:08,150
Sure.

205
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:13,550
Nothing.

206
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:15,550
I was just taking a stroll.

207
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,240
Did Prince Jing send you?

208
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,670
No.

209
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,600
The mooncakes in Prince Jing's residence
are awful.

210
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,030
I...

211
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,240
I brought him here to eat.

212
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,240
Awful?

213
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,080
Brought him here to eat?

214
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:26,870
Yes.

215
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,390
Lianqiao,

216
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,150
take six jin of leftover mooncakes

217
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:32,080
to Liujin.

218
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:33,200
Sure thing.

219
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,720
Uh.

220
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:37,510
That's so many.

221
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,840
I'm leaving.

222
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:40,600
Right.

223
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:43,270
I'll leave the accountant with you.

224
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:45,390
Feel free to give him orders.

225
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,510
I wasn't sent by His Highness.

226
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:57,670
This is

227
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,200
mooncakes?

228
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,000
Yes.

229
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,630
Made by Young Lady Qi.

230
00:10:02,690 --> 00:10:03,710
I specially asked Miss Qi

231
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:05,270
for them.

232
00:10:08,590 --> 00:10:10,320
These were really made
by Qi Yuan herself?

233
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:10,870
Yes.

234
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:13,200
She used

235
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,750
flour from Siam,

236
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:16,510
red beans from Persia,

237
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:19,000
molds made by craftsmen from Tubo,

238
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,630
and even this water

239
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:23,320
was transported

240
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,360
from Loulan.

241
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:26,600
Loulan?

242
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,510
Isn't that a desert?

243
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,750
Wouldn't it be short of water?

244
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,320
Anyway, it's there.

245
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,390
Just say whether
you believe in love or not.

246
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,790
If you do, eat it.

247
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:40,870
How is it?

248
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,390
Nice.

249
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,390
You should try it.

250
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,390
These mooncakes really
are unlike any other.

251
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:15,900
(Lofty Ambition)

252
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:45,150
Father! Mother! Zhen!

253
00:11:58,150 --> 00:12:02,790
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

254
00:12:03,130 --> 00:12:06,910
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

255
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:12,880
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

256
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:17,260
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

257
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:22,330
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

258
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:30,030
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
